              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "રજાઈ — rajāī — \"a quilt\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "શિયાળામાં રાત્રે હું ભારે રજાઈ ઓઢું છું. śiyāḷāmā̃ rātre hũ bhāre rajāī oḍhũ chũ. On winter nights I wrap myself in a heavy quilt."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "રજાઈ (rajāī) is usually traced to Persian razāī, \"a quilt\", a cover stuffed with cotton."
            }
          ]
        },
